# Find The Needle, Polish.
#
# An empty msgstr is not a bug: it means the string falls back to its message
# id, which is the English source text. See docs/localization/PLAN.md.
#
# Polish has three plural forms, so every plural entry here carries three
# msgstr lines: [0] for one, [1] for 2 to 4 (and 22 to 24, and so on), [2] for
# everything else, 5 to 21 included.
#
# To bring this file up to date after the English has moved:
#     python scripts/dev/gen_pot.py --merge pl
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: Find The Needle\n"
"Language: pl\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=3; plural=(n==1 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);\n"

msgid "SMALL"
msgstr "MAŁA"

msgid "Designed for weaker computers. A shorter hunt with room to walk around the pile."
msgstr "Dla słabszych komputerów. Krótsze szukanie i miejsce, żeby obejść stertę dookoła."

msgid "STANDARD"
msgstr "STANDARDOWA"

msgid "The yard as it comes. The pile the game was built around, under one steel roof."
msgstr "Zwykły plac. Sterta, wokół której powstała cała gra, pod jednym stalowym dachem."

msgid "BIG"
msgstr "DUŻA"

msgid "Twice the hay and a crown that stands over the wall plates. Bring a belt."
msgstr "Dwa razy więcej siana, a czubek wystaje ponad ściany. Przyda się taśma."

msgid "HUGE"
msgstr "OGROMNA"

msgid "Eight storeys of straw. The shed goes out to meet it and the roof still loses. Slow to load."
msgstr "Osiem pięter siana. Szopa rośnie razem ze stertą, a dach i tak przegrywa. Długo się wczytuje."

msgid "THE MOUNTAIN"
msgstr "GÓRA"

msgid "Fifty metres. It does not fit under the roof, it is not supposed to, and you will not finish it. Takes a minute to pour."
msgstr "Pięćdziesiąt metrów. Nie mieści się pod dachem, wcale nie musi i nigdy jej nie skończysz. Usypywanie trwa minutę."

